---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Band from "../components/Band.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Terms"
  description="Billing, cancellation, export, and what Common Parcel is not."
  path="/terms"
>
  <Hero eyebrow="Terms">
    <h1 class="t-display">Terms</h1>
    <p class="t-lede">The full terms are with counsel. The commercial ones below are settled and will not change when they land.</p>
  </Hero>
  <Band title="Billing">
    <ul class="rows"><li>Monthly. No contract and no setup fee.</li><li>Priced per lot on the published rate card, with a monthly minimum.</li><li>Migration is included.</li></ul>
  </Band>

  <Band title="Leaving" field>
    <p>Cancel any month. A full export of ledgers, documents, minutes and the record is available in the month you leave.</p>
  </Band>

  <Band title="What Parcel is not" note="See the price" noteHref="/pricing">
    <p>Parcel is not a law firm and does not give legal advice. It records what your documents and your state's statute say, and where each came from.</p>
    <p class="coda">Anything with legal weight waits for two officers to sign. That is a product constraint, not a setting.</p>
  </Band>

</Base>
